 "texto": "ph2d.property(\"amplitude\", 1.0)\nlocal brilho = 1\nfunction update(self, dt)\n  self.t = (self.t or 0) + dt\n  local d = brilho * self.amplitude * math.sin(self.t)\n  if d > 0 and self.ampiltude then\n    pirnt(d, nil, true)\n  end\n  ph2d.set(self.id, \"x\", d)\nend\n",
